WEBVTT

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:15.330
Kurumi!

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.460
Kurumi, wake up!

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:27.170
Sawa...

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:32.050
You were sleeping so soundly,
so I didn't really wanna bother you.

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:34.310
Everyone else already
went home by now.

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:37.390
Huh?

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:46.070
To receive a letter like this—

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:49.320
it's actually my first time.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.570
Is that so?

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.200
Yes.

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:54.950
But you already have
your answer, right?

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:56.910
That "You don't feel the same".

00:00:56.950 --> 00:01:01.250
Yes. But it never
crossed my mind—

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:03.670
to actually get
asked out by a boy.

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:07.420
Well, at least you can sort
your thoughts this weekend.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:12.340
If it's with someone I like
I don't mind going on a date.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:19.930
Kurumi! Between me and
"that person", who would you choose!?

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.390
H-Huh!?

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:23.560
W-well...

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:25.440
About that...

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.700
Of Course, I'd choose you...

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:47.800
<i>Normalcy was fun.</i>

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:50.170
<i>Our usual days was lovely.</i>

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:52.590
<i>Back then, life wasn't so complicated.</i>

00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:55.180
<i>And the world wasn't so hostile.</i>

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:00.810
But I hope one day, I'll find
someone that I actually hold dear.

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:03.190
In that case, I promise you—

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:06.810
That I'll root for you
once you find that person.

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:10.940
<i>It's only when you lose something—</i>

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:16.200
<i>that you finally realize
how precious those days were.</i>

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:21.750
<i>That's why I don't wish for something
like that to ever happen again.</i>

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:37.220
Where is Doll Master?

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:41.220
She ran away.
You can go after her if you want.

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:47.060
We just met you here,
so I can't really trust you.

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:50.730
Then feel free to
do what you want.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:02.410
I'll beat you up!

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:19.890
Aleph.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:36.490
It's me, Hibiki! I'm really sorry,
but could you please not shoot me!?

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.240
Still alive, huh?

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:43.120
I suppose that's a good news.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.290
Of course it's a good news!

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:46.960
Kurumi!

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:28.790
Why are you
ignoring me now?

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.920
I want the last fight
to be between you and me.

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:38.630
R-Right.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:43.720
Celestial Wolf!

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:46.560
For now, how about we
go somewhere else?

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:48.230
Sounds like a plan.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.560
The class is really empty now.

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:55.480
Was it actually used before?

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:58.570
It used to be full of various
Quasi-Spirits here.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:02.490
Is that so?

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.870
Does it remind you of anything?

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.120
Well, Tthat's—

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.840
Yes, yes, that is correct.

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:20.170
It did remind me of a certain person.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.380
What is their name?

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:24.550
I'm not telling you, though.

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:26.430
You're a meanie!

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:31.230
Thinking of such memories can be tricky—
sometimes you wish they were not real.

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:32.730
Is it about your lover?

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:34.980
Of course not.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:37.690
I guess that's all about me for now.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:42.410
Hibiki! Please tell me
about your thoughts.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.990
My thoughts?

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:49.790
If I remember correctly, you
wish to revive someone, right?

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:55.710
I was betrayed.

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:58.210
You were?

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:00.840
Yes. Indeed.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.720
The betrayal caused this
person to die unreasonably.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.850
She had done nothing wrong.

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:12.600
The truth is she was murdered
simply for being in the wrong place.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:18.440
That's why I have to see this through.
So I can win and have my wish granted.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:27.700
But! for that to happen, I have to eventually face you and fight you in the end, right?

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.410
Is something wrong?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.670
You're really aiming to win, huh?

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:42.130
Well, when you put it like that—

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:46.720
But I'm not planning to
give up no matter what!

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:50.180
Just so you know that
I won't go easy on you.

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:51.810
Please do!

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:00.150
Is that all?

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:02.900
Shut up! Shut up!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.660
I had heard that both
you and Ayame Takeshita—

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:08.950
Were among the strongest
in the Neighboring World.

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:13.540
What would Ayame Takeshita
say if she saw you this weak?

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:22.340
You're right! Ayame said she
adored my swordsmanship.

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:30.140
The Sword of Disorder.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:35.230
Behold, as you shall witness the
true swordplay of Isami Hijikata!

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:37.730
Go for it.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.920
I knew it! You're as
strong as I expected.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.930
Your attack almost
got me there.

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:14.220
That was all I could do with this sword, which was Ayame's favorite.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:18.480
That was a bad performance, but It can't be helped now.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:23.860
Ayame! 'Till we meet
again. Next Time!

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:32.160
Hold it!

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:36.200
Queen is making her move now.

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:37.540
What?

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:42.460
Therefore, I see no point to keep on
playing this Killing game any longer.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:46.630
Is that so? So you're up
to take her down now?

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:55.640
It's kinda quiet around here.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.110
Oh my. It's that cat.

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:06.980
Huh? A cat?

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:08.610
Yes, I saw it over there.

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:12.870
Kurumi! I understand you adore cats.

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:17.450
But please pull yourself together!
There can't be cats in the Neighboring World.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:21.170
You're wrong!
There was really a cat! I even petted it!

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:22.250
That can't be true!

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:24.670
Then I'll prove it to you!

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:27.170
Oh no! She got serious for real.

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:32.090
Wait, Kurumi! We're still
in the middle of this game!

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:36.390
Hey! Please wait!

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.610
I finally caught up to you.

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:51.360
Wandering around like that
is dangerous, you know!

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:53.280
How about we go
somewhere safe first?

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:01.790
What's this?

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:08.630
Yud.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.510
Kurumi!
Where are you?

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:17.640
Kurumi? I finally found you!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:23.480
Um, don't you think it's a bit careless to
let your guard down just for a cat, right?

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:34.150
I'm the type of girl who yearns
for this kind of moment.

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:37.700
Somehow your smile is unsettling.

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.160
Oh my!

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:44.710
Could it be my smile bothers you so much
because you feel guilty about something?

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:47.290
No way! Of course not!

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:59.890
Would you care to
give me an explanation?

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:03.890
And If you take another step forward,
I'll definitely shoot you, Queen!

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:07.770
What do you mean by that, Kurumi?

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:10.980
How could I be Queen?
That's too far-fetched!

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:19.410
I told you I'd shoot, right?

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:24.160
That hurts! You know!
Why did you suddenly—

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:29.210
For better or worse, I can no
longer trust anyone right now.

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:36.380
And then, upon investigating this paper here.
I learned that you are actually my enemy.

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:57.320
No! I'm not!
Please believe me!

00:11:57.950 --> 00:11:59.660
I'm not buying that.

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:18.930
And here I thought
it was going so well.

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:23.350
That story about reviving your friend was also a lie, wasn't it?

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:27.940
I figured you'd help me for sure
if I told you something like that.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:33.520
Playing <i>friends</i> with you
was so much fun while it lasted.

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:39.240
Who would have thought
a piece of paper could blow my cover.

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:44.240
Greetings,
Kurumi Tokisaki.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.200
Who are you exactly?

00:12:51.710 --> 00:12:53.790
You don't seem to understand at all, huh?

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:56.300
Well then. I guess It's
too much to ask for!

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:05.060
I am that part of yourself that you chose
to abandon. That's who I really am!

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:19.650
Don't! Get away from here!

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:32.460
Queen.

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:35.460
You guys are nuisance.

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:38.760
The last fight with
Kurumi Tokisaki belongs to me.

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:41.380
I won't let you!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:01.280
There goes my chance to fight her,
but it can't be helped now.

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:05.410
Talk about teaming up
and fighting like cowards.

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:07.700
You're the one to talk.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:12.290
The devil who disrupts this Neighboring World.
This is where we'll defeat you.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:15.540
Hmph. What foolish nonsense!

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:27.050
Dalet.

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:30.470
Are you feeling any better?

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:35.900
She stole your human appearance, yes?

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:40.610
"Abandoned?"
—said my other self?

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:43.700
"Class 2-A!"
"Kurumi Tokisaki!"

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:46.320
"Please head to the chapel!"

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.160
"Queen is requesting your audience!"

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.200
"I Repeat"

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:53.580
"Kurumi Tokisaki in Class 2-A!"

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:56.170
"Please head to the chapel at once!"

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:19.480
You're quite a stubborn one.

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.980
I-I'm not done!

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.110
You're done!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:34.160
Seven Treasure Pilgrims.
Rear Abrasion Circle.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:41.460
So you've been aiming
for this moment?

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:47.840
With this—

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.890
Moznaim.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:56.600
With this?

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:03.690
Why do you want to destroy
this Neighboring World?

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:06.570
I hate everything
about this place.

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:10.280
What about her?
Kurumi Tokisaki?

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:13.410
I hate her of course.

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:18.790
But after seeing her again,
I've realized that I actually hold her dear.

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:24.050
Yes. You see,
she's precious to me.

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:26.220
And yet I also hate her.

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:41.190
<i>Life is remorseless.</i>

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:45.480
<i>Our lives are nothing but sacrifices for the sake of our goals.</i>

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:48.360
<i>Thus, there is no need
to feel anything for us.</i>

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:51.490
<i>Having allies is
simply unnecessary.</i>

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:54.950
<i>That's what I used to believe.</i>

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:05.380
<i>But this warm sensation I've been feeling,
or these flowing tears, are not fake at all.</i>

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:13.100
<i>Ah! This dazzling sensation
could only mean love, right?</i>

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:23.110
It's you,
Kurumi Tokisaki.

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:32.240
Aleph.

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:00.890
Say, Kurumi.

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:06.230
Why must I be killed?

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:09.110
That voice.

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:17.450
<i>This burning flame takes me back...</i>

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:21.500
<i>Huh?</i>

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:29.210
<i>Why? Why?</i>

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:32.840
<i>Why did I have to die?</i>

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:38.970
<i>I didn't want to die. I wanted to live.</i>

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:46.650
<i>I didn't want to die like this.
I didn't want Kurumi to kill me.</i>

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:49.650
Take your revenge!

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:52.490
If you choose that path,

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:57.620
Every part of me will all be yours. I promise.

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:58.950
You are...?

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:02.790
I'm the part that
Kurumi Tokisaki abandoned.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:11.920
<i>I hate her! I hate that
you changed me like this!</i>

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:15.970
<i>I hate Kurumi for killing me.</i>

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:23.100
<i>I really hate being part of the world
that forces us to go through this.</i>

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:27.520
<i>I hate it! I hate it.</i>

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:32.190
Sawa.

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:34.820
You finally realize, huh?

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:36.150
Why?

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:40.490
After you killed me unreasonably,
I arrived here just like you.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:46.250
Now all those power from your abandoned self
resides in me. Isn't that wonderful?

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.630
Sawa! What do
you really desire?

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:55.470
At first, killing everyone
was my intention.

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:58.800
But after fighting you,
I've realized one thing.

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:04.600
What I want with Kurumi right now is
to get along again, like how we used to.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:08.480
<i>I failed to find a friend
like you in this place.</i>

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:13.690
<i>But that's all in the past.
I no longer care about others.</i>

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:19.070
<i>If Kurumi can be my friend again, like she used to be in the past.</i>

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:20.660
<i>Then it's all I want.</i>

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:24.660
Then why did you make
Quasi-Spirits kill one another?

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:27.580
I don't think
they have to die at all!

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:33.460
I did all that only to gain power,
but is that so shameless?

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:35.840
They're all already
dead anyway.

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:37.050
I see.

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:43.310
Sawa. Indeed, Sawa!
It's all my fault you ended up like this.

00:20:46.310 --> 00:20:47.600
Definitely.

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:52.480
But! To atone for all you've done here,
your fate will be the same as theirs!

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:58.950
<i>What you have become here
is completely my responsibility.</i>

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:03.030
<i>So I need to make sure
to see this through.</i>

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:06.750
Very well! If you really
chose to oppose me here—

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:09.580
I'll just have to keep you alive
and force you to come to my side.

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:13.960
Arie.

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:20.760
Zaphkiel!
Aleph!

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:31.560
Do you really think
you can stop me with that?

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:33.440
There's no harm in trying.

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:36.230
If that's what you really feel,
I won't hold back then.

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:37.610
Show me all you got!

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:40.400
Kashat.

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:42.530
Zayin.

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:50.960
Sawa.
No, Queen!

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:54.040
You're not even fit to
be part of your own game.

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:56.630
Despite the impressive
power you possess.

00:21:56.630 --> 00:21:59.550
You're missing the
most important thing here!

00:22:00.720 --> 00:22:01.970
Nonsense!

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:05.970
Dalet.

00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:15.900
This time—

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:19.190
I've got you now!

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:40.130
You can't let anything
distract you in a battle.

00:22:41.050 --> 00:22:46.050
You already lost the moment
you got fixated on me.

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:50.390
Kurumi! You're really are amazing.

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:53.230
Sawa. You—

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:59.730
I know. I've become
quite a monster, right?

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:01.740
Yes.

00:23:02.490 --> 00:23:05.780
You couldn't even
recognize me at first.

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:08.950
Now I understand why. I'm sorry.

00:23:09.620 --> 00:23:12.870
That still doesn't change
the fact I killed you.

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:14.790
No need to apologize.

00:23:16.460 --> 00:23:20.670
Kurumi. You're tearing up.

00:23:22.340 --> 00:23:26.970
About that girl I turned into a cat,
tell her I'm really sorry for all I did.

00:23:27.890 --> 00:23:30.180
I'm sure she'll forgive you.

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:33.220
One more thing! One more thing.

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:38.730
I hope your love blooms one day
with the one you hold dear.

00:23:41.900 --> 00:23:44.900
Sawa. Sawa!

00:23:47.030 --> 00:23:50.910
I'm... really sorry.

00:24:20.610 --> 00:24:22.610
Finally, I meet you again!

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:27.490
Y-You a-almost
grazed my face!

00:24:27.820 --> 00:24:30.740
Are you my enemy?
Or are you my enemy?

00:24:30.870 --> 00:24:33.240
Is enemy the only option here!?

00:24:33.370 --> 00:24:36.120
I'm on your side!
ON YOUR SIDE!

00:24:36.160 --> 00:24:39.920
I'm Hibiki Higoromo,
the white cat you saved!

00:24:40.420 --> 00:24:42.340
Actually, that reminds
me of something.

00:24:43.800 --> 00:24:46.170
The truth is my friend
wanted me to give you a me—

00:24:46.170 --> 00:24:51.590
My! They way you petted me back then,
I still can't believe of how cute you really were.

00:24:53.220 --> 00:24:55.140
Hey! There you go again!

00:24:55.560 --> 00:24:57.640
You're getting on my
nerves somehow.

00:24:58.020 --> 00:25:03.480
Come on! I'd be glad if you could stop
shooting me for such petty reasons.

00:25:03.900 --> 00:25:06.480
After all, I've just got
my human appearance back.

00:25:06.820 --> 00:25:09.820
So you're saying you can't
turn into a cat anymore?

00:25:09.950 --> 00:25:12.490
That might be a little difficult.

00:25:12.660 --> 00:25:17.450
How unfortunate. It really is!

00:25:17.450 --> 00:25:21.670
Could you please not be so
upset over this kind of stuff?

00:25:22.210 --> 00:25:25.710
I'm definitely better in
my human form than a cat! I assure you!

00:25:27.380 --> 00:25:31.430
Let's put that aside for now!
What do you want to do now, Kurumi?

00:25:32.550 --> 00:25:38.980
I've decided. I'll return to that
world to meet him once again.

00:25:39.850 --> 00:25:41.600
It's our promise after all.

00:25:42.150 --> 00:25:44.520
Then, I'll go with you!

00:25:44.610 --> 00:25:47.070
After all It's going to be
a long journey, right?

00:25:47.860 --> 00:25:49.240
Not necessarily.

00:25:49.240 --> 00:25:50.950
Don't be like that!

00:25:51.110 --> 00:25:54.740
You know, Kurumi, having one or two companions wouldn't hurt, right?

00:25:54.740 --> 00:25:57.540
I can't believe what
I'm hearing now.

00:26:01.830 --> 00:26:12.340
Leaping through time, that one wish

00:26:12.380 --> 00:26:28.900
Reflected in those eyes while embracing that day

00:26:33.740 --> 00:26:38.990
Encounters, parting, encounter

00:26:39.080 --> 00:26:55.340
Through the passage of time once again

00:26:55.390 --> 00:27:05.900
So that it doesn't spill over and scatter

00:27:05.980 --> 00:27:28.920
Engraved disappointment and wishing once again

00:27:48.730 --> 00:27:56.740
Deep in this heart, still lingering

00:27:56.740 --> 00:28:02.790
The you with the smile that never fades away

00:28:05.000 --> 00:28:19.970
Fiddling with fingertips, blushing cheeks, forever which we can never reach out to...

00:28:20.390 --> 00:28:23.970
Precious time

00:28:23.970 --> 00:28:28.850
holding on to it

00:28:28.850 --> 00:28:35.940
Words as the parting gift, while humming

00:28:37.030 --> 00:28:55.250
Just to hide those teary eyes by gazing at those days
